gc.parade.deflect.body:
This [[gc.serverrules|server rule]] is {gc_parade_deflect}; how the deflection works is explained under [[gc.parade]]. The server also sets the values below:

- Arrows and bolts too: {gc_parade_deflect_arrows}. On, they always fly back, fire, poison and frost arrows included; off, they count like any other projectile.
- Factor on the projectile's original damage: {gc_parade_deflect_damage}
